props rows, saved, pair, weather

band id=benchmarks tone=muted
  col size=lg gap=sm
    text "Benchmarks" tone=primary
    heading "Same UI. **A quarter of the tokens.**" size=lg
    text "Five common screens, each written twice: in Terse, and as the idiomatic shadcn + Tailwind TSX an agent writes today. Tokens counted with `o200k_base`." size=lg tone=muted
  grid cols=1,3
    stat "Fewer tokens, all five screens" @saved
    stat "Terse vs TSX, all five screens" @pair
    stat "Weather demo, Terse vs TSX" @weather
  grid cols=1,2
    card "Tokens per screen" description="Lower is better"
      chart bar x=dashboard,data-table,login,pricing,settings tooltip=true legend=true
        series "Terse" 188,161,122,102,182
        series "TSX" 927,630,441,379,753
    card "Results" description="Reproduce with: pnpm bench"
      table @rows cols=name,terse,tsx,saved headers="Screen,Terse,TSX,Saved"
  text "The TSX that Terse compiles to is about the same size as the TSX an agent writes directly, so the savings aren't bought with worse code. That TSX includes typed props, as agents write them." size=sm tone=muted
